<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-069-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.37505" lon="-120.913199"><name>SC26-069-C</name><cmt>SC26-069</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 42/100; not catch probability. Center 173 ft; nearby 170–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-049</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.375645998713566" lon="-120.91378931628427"/><trkpt lat="35.37492702792932" lon="-120.91391789605373"/><trkpt lat="35.374921326975745" lon="-120.91358784090667"/><trkpt lat="35.37429246523331" lon="-120.91371410079778"/><trkpt lat="35.37430006572803" lon="-120.91415417096914"/><trkpt lat="35.37402973899019" lon="-120.91416113000005"/><trkpt lat="35.37395102766333" lon="-120.91482355229112"/><trkpt lat="35.37376891041689" lon="-120.91471817322017"/><trkpt lat="35.37376321181039" lon="-120.91438812262021"/><trkpt lat="35.37313244925115" lon="-120.91440435807269"/><trkpt lat="35.37312294979233" lon="-120.91385427821987"/><trkpt lat="35.372762514137506" lon="-120.91386355783737"/><trkpt lat="35.37258989591741" lon="-120.91430825851499"/><trkpt lat="35.37304423989345" lon="-120.9145166932612"/><trkpt lat="35.373048038